1
00:00:00,658 --> 00:00:03,895
PayLink: USDC invoices in one link.

2
00:00:03,915 --> 00:00:06,167
The contract is live on Arc mainnet,

3
00:00:06,187 --> 00:00:08,679
and its source code is verified on Sourcify,

4
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:10,230
with an exact match.

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,876
The walkthrough below runs the same

6
00:00:11,896 --> 00:00:14,220
contract code on a local devnet,

7
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,353
with test accounts.

8
00:00:16,337 --> 00:00:18,769
A merchant enters the amount and a memo,

9
00:00:18,789 --> 00:00:20,356
and creates a payment link.

10
00:00:20,376 --> 00:00:22,639
That's free: there is no transaction,

11
00:00:22,659 --> 00:00:24,832
just a link and a QR code.

12
00:00:24,852 --> 00:00:27,180
The merchant's card is now watching the chain.

13
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,319
The payer opens the link,

14
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:32,143
and sees exactly what they pay: the amount,

15
00:00:32,163 --> 00:00:33,886
the recipient, the memo,

16
00:00:33,906 --> 00:00:35,861
and the network fee, in dollars.

17
00:00:36,557 --> 00:00:38,496
One click, one transaction.

18
00:00:38,516 --> 00:00:40,660
USDC is Arc's native token,

19
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,246
so there is no approve step,

20
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:43,764
and no second gas token.

21
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,320
Finality is deterministic.

22
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,832
The merchant's card flips to Paid by itself,

23
00:00:48,852 --> 00:00:50,241
and that payment is final.

24
00:00:50,749 --> 00:00:52,980
The same invoice can't be paid twice.

25
00:00:53,638 --> 00:00:55,493
The dashboard reads every payment

26
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:57,128
straight from the contract.

27
00:00:57,148 --> 00:00:59,303
No backend, no indexer.

28
00:00:59,323 --> 00:01:01,326
Export it to CSV for your books.

29
00:01:02,734 --> 00:01:04,529
PayLink is open source,

30
00:01:04,549 --> 00:01:07,726
live on Arc mainnet, and verified on Sourcify.

31
00:01:07,746 --> 00:01:08,992
Links are in the description.

